<body>
    <h1>CareerPilot =E2=80=93 Logo Research</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"8c1ba8f0-7d27-3b50-84b5-77b1e1e33c74"><time datetime=
=3D"2026-10-06" class=3D"date-past">06 Oct 2026</time> =C2=B7 Owner: Dan Gl=
ogoveanu =C2=B7 Status: <span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge=
-visual-refresh aui-lozenge-complete">IN REVIEW</span></p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"5e01abb4-4f7f-3b55-8b88-09fd886c4b09"><strong>Brand name:</s=
trong> CareerPilot ("AI" dropped from the brand). <strong>Signature idea:</=
strong> the "o" in "Pilot" is drawn as a crosshair, standing for precise ma=
tching to the right role. <strong>Recommendation:</strong> Option A, the re=
ticle wordmark.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"09681ca6-49c2-3a1d-9978-d8df55d4e7cd" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=
=80=93LogoResearch-Designcriteria">Design criteria</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ca517ad1-3a2a-380d-b0b2-31c20b7d65bc">Every option is checke=
d against four tests. If it fails any of them, it is not finished.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"b06d1315-df2a-3042-b687-6cb=
b5f8ee1d7" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3e2b039a-7888-3ffe-9c1d-0e6e34b3d484">
<th data-local-id=3D"243ec502-64d0-308e-b75f-920084651bc6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b1c4b050-3af4-3ec6-86dd-353886afcc96">Test</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"eb717790-fb5f-3863-a04c-ff40e3de7a6d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"71a9a9e6-982d-37cd-bcf4-346c2af0121d">What it means for Care=
erPilot</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"411c72cd-0794-34f4-be2f-21176ea7025c">
<td data-local-id=3D"a0cc49ad-7647-3a0c-b8af-b54f52ca215f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e90be629-5c72-3078-8bc2-bb40c85702c5">Survives 16 px</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"5668ea3f-09e1-33c2-8883-f2635c75e9af" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f655dfaf-3a8d-30cf-8d9b-674900f79aae">The crosshair must sti=
ll read as a favicon; drop detail where needed.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b9be4052-59b1-312c-bfd2-55f2cedd34a8">
<td data-local-id=3D"95a7feac-c72a-3e8d-b225-6803982b6ef8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"870cb12a-5c93-332b-aef7-1133e120140b">Works in one colour</p=
></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f22e2b13-d718-3617-b9a3-db5809882c94" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"975f34e3-62e0-31e0-9775-3dabfa33243a">Each mark has a single=
-colour version for print, stamps and embossing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"86427c54-ddd5-3ed4-ae74-691d14fad176">
<td data-local-id=3D"85a0d41e-56d2-355e-aebd-d3840861a708" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6fe33e8b-76b9-3f87-a112-7298969f3eff">Describable</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0809ea67-750e-3dd2-bdfe-0d8f6cf916ce" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"118cc4dd-b86e-3bd3-97d7-7ee18c2a16ba">One sentence: "CareerP=
ilot, where the o is a crosshair."</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"78e9d4d6-4f00-3b6f-9906-75256d0a35f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"ceff6b28-a462-32c1-b82e-7b5e33738813" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fff450e-188e-372c-8008-3efe27aabbe0">Not a trend</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0462a72d-c009-3d63-8b46-22a2382bdbf6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c603fc02-a89d-3d16-ae08-a0cf482ac241">No gradients, 3D or ma=
scot; geometric shapes only.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"b8f62a96-6f5b-3850-84ee-65f872f26a8a" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=
=80=93LogoResearch-OptionA=C2=B7Reticlewordmark(recommended)">Option A =C2=
=B7 Reticle wordmark (recommended)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"da87c770-6768-3e39-bf0e-183e4cbaa6c0"><strong>Type:</strong>=
 wordmark, the cheapest kind to get right. <strong>Description:</strong> "C=
areerPilot, where the o is a crosshair."</p><span class=3D"confluence-embed=
ded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img=
 class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"Option A reticle w=
ordmark on light, dark and one colour, with icon at 64, 32 and 16 px" width=
=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"0821e0a7361e405660c983d0833cdf1670f5c77228=
b767a6eabe16294cba3342" data-image-src=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/4554754/option-a-reticle-wordmark.svg?version=3D1=
&amp;modificationDate=3D1791271395949&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" da=
ta-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4620289" data-=
linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data=
-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"option-a-reticle-wordmark.svg" data-base-=
url=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-=
type=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4554754" data-l=
inked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=3D"6335f9b5-70f6-4a43-=
a1d8-ba80f0aef6fd" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"121"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"b29f35da-e8e1-3dc6-9a25-cc9c81fb2507">
<li local-id=3D"5952fb69-f0dd-3091-90c5-857475152caa">
<p local-id=3D"e2998251-9884-3947-9d80-8567d6cb4795"><strong>Why it works:<=
/strong> the name gets learned, not a symbol. The orange centre dot is the =
only accent and stands for "your target role". The icon is just the "o", so=
 the app icon and favicon come free.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e02e1a9-1b6d-3cea-9646-9e0aabcd82bf">
<p local-id=3D"8faf82d2-9bbf-3a9a-b9e7-6e41029a9dd6"><strong>Watch out:</st=
rong> outer ticks read as a rifle scope if they get too long, so keep them =
short. The ticks widen the letter, so check the kerning around "l" and "t".=
</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"0303949b-59c7-3b85-bcba-6e262c072fc7" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=
=80=93LogoResearch-OptionB=C2=B7Two-weightwordmark">Option B =C2=B7 Two-wei=
ght wordmark</h2>
<p local-id=3D"db3a8b0f-5b2f-319f-9506-572192fdcf49"><strong>Type:</strong>=
 wordmark. <strong>Description:</strong> "career light, pilot bold, the o i=
s an orange notched ring."</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapp=
er image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"Option B two-weight wordmark on =
light, dark and one colour, with icon at 64, 32 and 16 px" width=3D"468" lo=
ading=3D"lazy" src=3D"99bc0b3fbddc9d22bee35b5125cc3a6b86dc951eb5a1b29e9417b=
a6e5867024d" data-image-src=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki/downlo=
ad/attachments/4554754/option-b-two-weight-wordmark.svg?version=3D1&amp;mod=
ificationDate=3D1791271396841&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unres=
olved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4653057" data-linked-r=
esource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-=
resource-default-alias=3D"option-b-two-weight-wordmark.svg" data-base-url=
=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-typ=
e=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4554754" data-link=
ed-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=3D"4887dcc8-3c96-4fe3-a7e=
c-62f35e86d755" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"121"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"fed08b2d-7571-3f7a-8569-27f3a02c3e21">
<li local-id=3D"978275c9-3403-3df4-a8a0-0f96353c565e">
<p local-id=3D"c0d4384f-a93e-38de-82f7-75cb836d7133"><strong>Why it works:<=
/strong> lowercase and two weights feel approachable for graduates like Len=
a. "pilot" in bold puts the stress on guidance. The crosshair stays inside =
the letter outline, so it never looks like a weapon.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f53c5c74-5600-3b5e-8915-68c6ef83558a">
<p local-id=3D"cb6b5b8c-9985-3428-8d3c-c7ea85b01c13"><strong>Watch out:</st=
rong> the orange ring on white is about 3.5:1 contrast, fine for a graphic =
but never for text. The light weight thins out under about 20 px; use the b=
old-only version there.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"80c2c7a9-44ee-3666-bcf7-d5c48c58d05d" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=
=80=93LogoResearch-OptionC=C2=B7Combinationmark">Option C =C2=B7 Combinatio=
n mark</h2>
<p local-id=3D"1be6135a-5618-3522-bbac-92b5ba69a50a"><strong>Type:</strong>=
 symbol plus name, splittable for app icons. <strong>Description:</strong> =
"A navy tile with a crosshair, next to CareerPilot."</p><span class=3D"conf=
luence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manua=
l-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"Option=
 C combination mark on light, dark and one colour, with app icon at 64, 32 =
and 16 px" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"df198f11d173047b9849c8a644=
4fc8e549a734a9e4536994d40f2161f5e6ef01" data-image-src=3D"https://glogovean=
u.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4554754/option-c-combination-mark=
.svg?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1791271397665&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&=
amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"4685825" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=
=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"option-c-combination-=
mark.svg" data-base-url=3D"https://glogoveanu.atlassian.net/wiki" data-link=
ed-resource-content-type=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resource-container-i=
d=3D"4554754" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=3D=
"fafd09b8-72a2-45f9-a820-03eb6fdc3a03" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"1=
21"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"23f80d04-27e4-3c3f-8758-da6874cb0bd2">
<li local-id=3D"f52df4b5-d37e-32dd-bf75-b26b9c4501ed">
<p local-id=3D"e719ba15-8849-3910-a606-0f97bc8980d4"><strong>Why it works:<=
/strong> the tile is a ready-made app and social icon and the name stays pl=
ain and readable. The ticks point inward, so it reads as "focus", not "scop=
e". The icon and wordmark are separate Figma components.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d8da11b5-4ac3-38ba-82e0-25b26f974f37">
<p local-id=3D"042bbb4c-3f91-3bbf-a8e6-442c563369ac"><strong>Watch out:</st=
rong> the name itself has no crosshair, so the "o" idea lives only in the i=
con. At 16 px the ticks must be dropped, which adds a variant to maintain.<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"5ba5499e-acdf-3f9a-947d-62ec126c32ba" id=3D"CareerPilot=E2=
=80=93LogoResearch-Comparison">Comparison</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e4fa72c0-5a80-39ee-b034-b28=
7d785519a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"33160117-9ba8-3dc5-90eb-0fb9b6081e6f">
<th data-local-id=3D"f0558d91-da18-3d03-9034-51c8210d9eb7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"791d4c18-c8b1-363c-be82-89a8f406d59a">Test</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6b99c3c8-66d1-37b4-9033-b15fa11bb7b4" class=3D"conflue=
