ark</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"20eeed8d-fe37-3f7b-8d22-f8741f3c3b0d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3eea2651-fdd9-3139-a3b6-f8bf255969b1">B =C2=B7 Two-weight wo=
rdmark</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fb76a362-6e4b-3ee0-ad08-df040442a8cb" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3ad3b7bf-f1d0-336a-ab8d-191a8f726e06">C =C2=B7 Combination m=
ark</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"846e354d-a250-3d65-83df-c985162bc097">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce17653e-64fd-38da-8239-2a71c0e66baa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"361ac236-c38c-36a9-a77e-2334750b3598">Survives 16 px</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"4d02767d-d21f-364c-894e-504147855241" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d95f576-6e3f-3441-9e99-e55ea43fae07"><span class=3D"status-=
macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-lozenge-success">PASS</spa=
n></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c446b6c-7d04-3032-8723-c9a02d1d1dd1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fdf70cb0-e14c-37f5-83d1-d97f38bc2cbf"><span class=3D"status-=
macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-visual-refresh aui-lozenge-current">BOLD-ONLY=
 BELOW 20 PX</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"750f700c-c60f-3a54-b249-91baa8b256fe" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a1ce76c0-0580-3232-b07c-77838df54d02"><span class=3D"status-=
